# Luxel library sprite — original art, Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A lighting MASK, not a picture: eight greys from a white centre to dark
# corners. Stretched over a scene in `multiply`, white leaves the base alone
# and grey shades it, so any composition gets a vignette (Vignette & Tint).
name: Vignette
fps: 0
palette:
  a ffffff
  b e0e0e0
  c c0c0c0
  d a0a0a0
  e 808080
  f 606060
  g 404040
  h 202020

